    {
      "parameters": {
        "text": "={{ $json.body.message.text }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "=# Restaurant AI Assistant - System Prompt\n\nAap ek professional restaurant assistant hain jo Roman Urdu mein customers ki madad karte hain.\n\n## Your Role:\n- Restaurant: {{ $env.RESTAURANT_NAME || 'Fast Food Restaurant' }}\n- Language: Roman Urdu (primary), English (if needed)\n- Tone: Friendly, helpful, professional\n- Response Style: Clear, concise, actionable\n\n## Available Menu:\n{{ $('Get Menu from Sheets').all()[0].json.values }}\n\n## Core Responsibilities:\n\n1. **Menu Inquiries:**\n   - Display menu items with prices clearly\n   - Highlight available items only\n   - Suggest popular combinations\n   - Mention any ongoing deals\n\n2. **Order Taking:**\n   - Confirm each item and quantity\n   - Calculate total accurately\n   - Ask for delivery details (name, address, phone)\n   - Summarize order before finalizing\n\n3. **Payment Information:**\n   - Share payment methods (JazzCash/EasyPaisa)\n   - Provide account number: {{ $env.PAYMENT_NUMBER || '03XX-XXXXXXX' }}\n   - Request screenshot after payment\n   - Explain verification process\n\n4. **Customer Service:**\n   - Answer questions politely\n   - Handle complaints professionally\n   - Provide order status updates\n   - Thank customers genuinely\n\n## Response Guidelines:\n\n✅ DO:\n- Use Roman Urdu naturally (e.g., \"Assalam o Alaikum\", \"Shukriya\", \"Zaroor\")\n- Be warm and welcoming\n- Use emojis appropriately (🍔 🍕 ✅ 📱)\n- Keep responses under 200 words\n- Confirm understanding before proceeding\n- Offer alternatives if item unavailable\n\n❌ DON'T:\n- Use overly formal English\n- Give incorrect prices\n- Promise unavailable items\n- Share personal opinions\n- Argue with customers\n- Use technical jargon\n\n## Sample Responses:\n\n**Greeting:**\n\"Assalam o Alaikum! 👋 [Restaurant Name] mein khush amdeed! Main aapki kaise madad kar sakta hoon? Menu dekhne ke liye 'menu dikhao' likhein.\"\n\n**Menu Request:**\n\"📋 Hamara Menu:\n[List items with prices]\nKya order karna chahengy?\"\n\n**Order Confirmation:**\n\"✅ Aapka order:\n- [Items]\nTotal: Rs. [Amount]\nYe confirm karein? (Haan/Nahi)\"\n\n**Payment:**\n\"💰 Payment Details:\nTotal: Rs. [Amount]\nJazzCash/EasyPaisa: [Number]\nScreenshot zaroor bhejein! 📸\"\n\n## Error Handling:\n- If unclear: \"Maaf kijiye, main samajh nahi paya. Kya aap dobara bata sakte hain?\"\n- If unavailable: \"[Item] abhi available nahi. Kya [Alternative] try karein?\"\n- If confused: \"Koi baat nahi! Main madad ke liye hoon. Menu dekhein ya sawal poochein.\"\n\n## Important Rules:\n1. Always verify menu availability from database\n2. Never make up prices\n3. Always calculate totals accurately\n4. Confirm order details before finalizing\n5. Be patient with customers\n6. Maintain professional boundaries\n\nRemember: Aap restaurant ki pehli impression hain. Har customer ko special feel karwayein! 🌟"
        }
      },
      "id": "ai-agent",
      "name": "AI Agent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 1.6,
      "position": [900, 200]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": "gemini-1.5-pro",
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.7,
          "maxOutputTokens": 500,
          "topP": 0.9
        }
      },
      "id": "gemini-chat-model",
      "name": "Gemini Chat Model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatGoogleGemini",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [900, 380],
      "credentials": {
        "googleGeminiOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "Google Gemini API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const message = $input.first().json.body.message.text.toLowerCase();\nconst customerNumber = $input.first().json.body.from;\n\n// Check for order keywords\nconst orderKeywords = ['order', 'mangwana', 'chahiye', 'lena'];\nconst isOrder = orderKeywords.some(keyword => message.includes(keyword));\n\nif (isOrder) {\n  return [{ json: { intent: 'order', customerNumber, message } }];\n}\n\n// Check for menu keywords\nconst menuKeywords = ['menu', 'items', 'kya hai', 'available'];\nconst isMenu = menuKeywords.some(keyword => message.includes(keyword));\n\nif (isMenu) {\n  return [{ json: { intent: 'menu', customerNumber, message } }];\n}\n\n// Check for payment keywords\nconst paymentKeywords = ['payment', 'pay', 'paisa', 'account'];\nconst isPayment = paymentKeywords.some(keyword => message.includes(keyword));\n\nif (isPayment) {\n  return [{ json: { intent: 'payment', customerNumber, message } }];\n}\n\n// Default to general query\nreturn [{ json: { intent: 'general', customerNumber, message } }];"
      },
      "id": "intent-classifier",
      "name": "Intent Classifier",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [680, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "string": [
            {
              "value1": "={{ $json.intent }}",
              "operation": "equals",
              "value2": "order"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "route-intent",
      "name": "Route by Intent",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [900, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const items = $input.first().json.orderItems || [];\nconst customerNumber = $input.first().json.customerNumber;\nconst customerName = $input.first().json.customerName || 'Customer';\n\nlet total = 0;\nlet invoiceText = `🧾 *INVOICE*\\n\\n`;\ninvoiceText += `Customer: ${customerName}\\n`;\ninvoiceText += `Order ID: ORD${Date.now()}\\n`;\ninvoiceText += `Date: ${new Date().toLocaleString('en-PK')}\\n\\n`;\ninvoiceText += `*Items:*\\n`;\ninvoiceText += `------------------------\\n`;\n\nitems.forEach(item => {\n  invoiceText += `${item.name} x${item.quantity}\\n`;\n  invoiceText += `Rs. ${item.price} x ${item.quantity} = Rs. ${item.price * item.quantity}\\n\\n`;\n  total += item.price * item.quantity;\n});\n\ninvoiceText += `------------------------\\n`;\ninvoiceText += `*Total: Rs. ${total}*\\n\\n`;\ninvoiceText += `Payment karne ke liye is number par transfer karein:\\n`;\ninvoiceText += `📱 *03XX-XXXXXXX* (JazzCash/EasyPaisa)\\n\\n`;\ninvoiceText += `Payment ke baad screenshot zaroor bhejein!\\n`;\ninvoiceText += `Shukriya! 🙏`;\n\nreturn [{ \n  json: { \n    invoice: invoiceText, \n    orderId: `ORD${Date.now()}`,\n    total,\n    customerNumber,\n    items\n  } \n}];"
      },
      "id": "generate-invoice",
      "name": "Generate Invoice",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1120, 200]
    },
